Translation patch: `ParsedNamedParams::parse` (`is_ascii_whitespace`)

Change: `c.is_ascii_whitespace()` (in `parse_step`, state `MaybeInDoubleDashComment2`) becomes `matches!(c, b'\t' | b'\n' | b'\x0C' | b'\r' | b' ')`.
Why: `u8::is_ascii_whitespace` is a `core` function that Aeneas does not model (and we do not translate dependencies).
Behaviour: Identical: this `matches!` is the body of `u8::is_ascii_whitespace` in core (`library/core/src/num/mod.rs`: horizontal tab, line feed, form feed, carriage return, space).

